A||||17||Tigger||Pontiac Vibe||||1||
Z||000000||Tigger||01-21-2001||12:28 AM||||Last week I took some pictures of the Pontiac Vibe concept/production car at the Detroit Auto Show.  It's definitely an improvement although I think anything is an improvement over the Aztek.  Anyway, people looking at it appeared to like it or at least it didn't turn them away.<P>I took a pictures of the new Viper and Saleen supercar and many others, enjoy.<P>I converted the images into links so the page would take as long to load.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/vibe1.jpg" TARGET=_blank>Vibe Picture 1</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/vibe2.jpg" TARGET=_blank>Vibe Picture 2</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/vibe3.jpg" TARGET=_blank>Vibe Picture 3</A>   <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/naias2001viper.jpg" TARGET=_blank>2001 Viper</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/naias2001saleen.jpg" TARGET=_blank>Saleen Supercar</A><p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 01-22-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||Seanh||01-21-2001||12:47 AM||||I shouldnt say this, but I actually like the Aztek. I am not to crazy about the Vibe though. One other thing, I hate the look of the new Vipers. I like the old look to them, like about 96 I think. New ones look nasty I think.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Haze_Performance||01-21-2001||01:44 AM||||SALEEN BABY!!!! OH YEA!!!!!<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/WS6Fiero.gif">    <BR><B>"AHHHHH!!!!!!!! All Fiero's don't start on fire you BONEHEAD!!!!"</B>||||reg||7
