Z||000004||Shiner||01-21-2001||10:43 AM||||That thing doesn't look much better than the Asstek to me.  ||||reg||1
Z||000005||Fformula88||01-21-2001||10:56 AM||||I thought Pontiac's moto was "We're Driving Excitement", not "We're driving boredom!"  No offense to the Vibe, but its an econo-station wagon with a Toyota drivetrain.   This is a far cry from excitement in my book.  Ater they kill the Firebird, the sporty division will be left without anything close to a sports car.  <P>I like the new Viper, but wish they hadn't gotten rid of the more radical side scoops behind the front wheels.  I could live with it for the added ponies  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>John<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">    <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1997 Ford Probe SE<BR>AOL IM: Fformula88||||reg||1
Z||000006||Shaft||01-21-2001||01:25 PM||||I think the Vibe is a pretty cool car. It's a joint venture between Toyota and Pontiac and it has the drivetrain out of a Celica GTS (180 hp i-4 mated to a 6-speed). But I'd hate to say it, but I like the Toyota version of the car MUCH better than the look of the Vibe.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Alex2004||01-21-2001||02:25 PM||||I think the new vipers look alot like the honda S2000, well the headlights do atleast. The old ones are way better.  I like the aerodynamics of the vibe better than the azteck. The azteck would be cooler, i think, if they redesigned the back so it isn't so boxy looking.  The Saleen is awesome, kinda reminds me of the McLaren.<P>Alex...||||reg||13
Z||000008||GT-maniac||01-21-2001||04:43 PM||||The Aztek is so ugly I can't believe it made it into production. It's all awkward lines and tacked on styling cues. Now the saleen that's a real car. The aztek is an automotive  nightmare.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000009||Pontiaddict||01-21-2001||05:32 PM||||If you think that the Aztec is bad looking. You should go to GM's website and look at the Olds Recon. (Their version of the same car, with freight train styling) It's the real reason that Gm killed the Oldsmobile nameplate. <P>If we weren't all driving 15 year old cars, then maybe we would have more influence over what Pontiac builds.||||reg||1
Z||000010||btoth||01-21-2001||05:34 PM||||I went to the Detroit Auto Show this year.  Had to see the Diablo's up close (we don't get them at the Cleveland show).  That new Saleen does look a lot like a McLaren but with a bunch of vents all over it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  I like the original Vipers with the side exhaust pipes myself...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Tigger... how did you take such awesome pictures!?  I could never get all the people out of my way long enough to back up far enough to take the pictures!  At least my Diablo pics came out perfect.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||10
